WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.992
The External transfer destinations tab lists the outside numbers agents and phone menus

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:10.706
may transfer calls to.

00:00:10.706 --> 00:00:12.420
Click Add destination.

00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:19.953
Enter a Display name, for example After-hours answering service, and its E.164 address,

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:24.217
which is the full international number with a plus sign.

00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:28.711
Untick Enabled to keep a row but stop offering it.

00:00:28.711 --> 00:00:32.129
Add a row for each destination, and click Save.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.540
Tick Let agents transfer to numbers that are not on this list only

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.676
if agents may type any number.

00:00:48.676 --> 00:00:53.421
They also need the permission to transfer Contact Center calls externally.

00:00:53.421 --> 00:00:56.980
Emergency and premium-rate numbers are always refused.

